# Normalize line endings so cross-repo diffs against the Vector vendored copy
# (hook-lab/Vector/native/src/kpm/*) are not drowned in CRLF/LF noise. The C
# sources are stored LF in-index in both repos; this keeps the working tree LF too.
# After adding this file, run `git add --renormalize .` to apply it to already-tracked files.
*.c   text eol=lf
*.h   text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
